      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "Concept ACK on the footnote fix. \"Other curves\" was wrong: BIP374 takes its notation from BIP327, which fixes secp256k1 and its order n, and n is not an input, so G is the only curve parameter that can change. The rewritten verification sentence, with `A = a⋅G` and `C = a⋅B`, is also clearer.\n",
