      "body": "Nit: I'd keep \"iff\" here, which means \"if and only if\" and matches BIP340's identical line. With the \"Fail if\" steps above, both words give the same result, so this is only about consistency.\n\n```suggestion\n* Return success iff no failure occurred before reaching this point.\n```\n",
